          %p
            This equivalence makes manifest the
            %a{:href => "Whitehead-generalized+cohomology#AxiomsReduced"} characteristic properties
            of cohomology: homotopy invariance, exactness and wedge property, since these are now immediately implied by general abstract properties of mapping spaces.
          %p
