          %h2#References References
          %h3#classical_theory__bundles_and_groups Classical theory – bundles and groups
          %p
            The classical notion of non-abelian (
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/%C4%8Cech+cohomology"}> Čech
            \-)cohomology in degree 1 and its relation to
            = succeed "/" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/fiber+bundles"} fiber bundles
            = succeed ":" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/principal+bundles"} principal bundles
          %ul
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Alexander+Grothendieck"}> Alexander Grothendieck
                , Chapter V of:
                = succeed "," do
                  %em A General Theory of Fibre Spaces With Structure Sheaf
                = succeed "," do
                  %a{:href => "https://webusers.imj-prg.fr/~leila.schneps/grothendieckcircle/Kansasnotes.pdf"} pdf
                = succeed "&rbrack;" do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/files/Grothendieck-FibreSpaces.pdf", :title => "pdf"} pdf
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Jean+Frenkel"}> Jean Frenkel
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Cohomologie à valeurs dans un faisceau non abélien
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Jean+Frenkel"}> Jean Frenkel
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Cohomologie non abélienne et espaces fibrés
                %strong 85
                (1957) 135-220 &amp;lbrack;
                %a{:href => "http://www.numdam.org/item/BSMF_1957__85__135_0"}> numdam:BSMF_1957__85__135_0
                \&amp;rbrack;
          %p Review:
          %ul
            %li
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Torsten+Wedhorn"}> Torsten Wedhorn
              ,
              = succeed "," do
                %em Torsors and Non-abelian Čech Cohomology
              = succeed "," do
                %em Manifolds, Sheaves, and Cohomology
              = succeed "&rbrack;" do
                %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1007/978-3-658-10633-1"} doi:10.1007/978-3-658-10633-1
          %p
            Review in topological spaces (via
            = succeed "):" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/classifying+spaces"} classifying spaces
          %ul
            %li
              %p
                Nicolas Addington,
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Fiber bundles and nonabelian cohomology
                %em
                  %a{:href => "https://www.math.uchicago.edu/~gstc/"} Graduate Student Topology Conference
                (2007) &amp;lbrack;
                %a{:href => "http://pages.uoregon.edu/adding/notes/gstc2007.pdf"}> pdf
                \&amp;rbrack;
            %li#Mitchell11
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Stephen+Mitchell"}> Stephen Mitchell
                , around Theorem 7.4 in:
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Notes on principal bundles and classifying spaces
                = succeed "," do
                  %a{:href => "https://sites.math.washington.edu/~mitchell/Notes/prin.pdf"} pdf
                = succeed "&rbrack;" do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/files/MitchellPrincipalBundles.pdf", :title => "pdf"} pdf
            %li#RudolfSchmidt17
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Gerd+Rudolph"}> Gerd Rudolph
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Matthias+Schmidt"} Matthias Schmidt
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Differential Geometry and Mathematical Physics Part II. Fibre Bundles, Topology and Gauge Fields
                = succeed "&rbrack;" do
                  %a{:href => "https://link.springer.com/book/10.1007/978-94-024-0959-8"} doi:10.1007/978-94-024-0959-8
          %p See also:
          %ul
            %li
              Jinpeng An. Zhengdong Wang,
              = succeed "," do
                %em Nonabelian cohomology with coefficients in Lie groups
              %strong 360
              (2008) 3019-3040 &amp;lbrack;
              %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1090/S0002-9947-08-04278-5"}> doi:10.1090/S0002-9947-08-04278-5
              \&amp;rbrack;
          %p
            The case of
            = succeed ":" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/nonabelian+group+cohomology"} nonabelian group cohomology
          %ul
            %li#Milne17
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/James+Milne"}> James Milne
              , Section 27.a (of the
              = succeed "," do
                %a{:href => "https://www.jmilne.org/math/CourseNotes/iAG200.pdf"} pdf
              = succeed "," do
                %em Algebraic Groups
              = succeed "," do
                %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1017/9781316711736"} doi:10.1017/9781316711736
              = succeed "," do
                %a{:href => "http://www.jmilne.org/math/Books/iag.html"} webpage
              = succeed ")" do
                %a{:href => "https://www.jmilne.org/math/CourseNotes/iAG200.pdf"} pdf
          %h3#CategorifiedTheory Categorified theory – 2-bundles/gerbes
          %p
            Early discussion, of higher non-abelian cohomology with
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/coefficients"} coefficients
            in certain
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/2-groups"} 2-groups
            (implicitly):
          %ul
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Paul+Dedecker"}> Paul Dedecker
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Cohomologie à coefficients non abéliens et espaces fibrés
                %strong 41
                (1955) 1132-1146 &amp;lbrack;
                %a{:href => "https://www.persee.fr/doc/barb_0001-4141_1955_num_41_1_69497"}> persee:barb_0001-4141_1955_num_41_1_69497
                \&amp;rbrack;
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Paul+Dedecker"}> Paul Dedecker
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Cohomologie de dimension 2 à coefficients non abéliens
                %strong 247
                (1958) 1160-1163 &amp;lbrack;
                %a{:href => "https://gallica.bnf.fr/ark:/12148/bpt6k7258/f192.item.r=dedecker"}> BnF
                \&amp;rbrack;
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Paul+Dedecker"}> Paul Dedecker
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Sur La Cohomologie Non Abelienne I (Dimension Deux)
                %strong 12
                (1960) 231-251 &amp;lbrack;
                %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.4153/CJM-1960-019-7"}> doi:10.4153/CJM-1960-019-7
                \&amp;rbrack;
          %p
            and with coefficients in certain
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/3-groups"} 3-groups
            presented by
            = succeed ":" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/crossed+squares"} crossed squares
          %ul
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Paul+Dedecker"}> Paul Dedecker
                , A. Frei,
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Les relations d’équivalence des morphismes de la suite exacte de cohomologie non abêlienne
                %strong 262
                (1966) 1298-1301
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Paul+Dedecker"}> Paul Dedecker
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Three dimensional non-abelian cohomology for groups
                = succeed ")" do
                  %a{:href => "http://www.ams.org/mathscinet/pdf/263894.pdf?pg1=IID&s1=55880&vfpref=html&r=15"} MathSciNet
          %p
            The correct definition using
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/crossed+modules"} crossed modules
            of sheaves then appeared in
          %ul
            %li#Debremaeker76
              Raymond Debremaeker,
              = succeed "," do
                %em Cohomologie met waarden in een gekruiste groepenschoof op een situs
              = succeed "," do
                %em Cohomology with values in a sheaf of crossed groups over a site
              %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/1702.02128"} 1702.02128
          %p
            Of
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/algebra"} algebraic
            = succeed ":" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/structures"} structures
